  "description": "Rosanna's Secret: A Vampire's Tale is a comedy-horror fiction podcast series about Rosanna, a 29-year-old who falls for a strange newcomer and discovers that he is a vampire. The story follows her adjustment to life as a vampire while she keeps a secret of her own.",
  "officialDescription": {
    "text": "Rosanna is a sweet 29-year-old, (who looks younger) and loves all things sunny and sweet. She falls quickly in love with a strange, oddball that comes to the village and, without seeing all the obvious signs - Finds out the hard way he's a bloodsucking vampire. But that's not all there is to this story, oh no... In this series we are introduced to many other weird and wonderful characters, all whilst Rosanna gets to grips with living life as a vampire. But she has one secret of her own, that she plans to keep hidden...",
